0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub, port A medium motor, 8T-24T-24T gears, two independent cord loads.
0 // Standard LDraw meshes are external and keep their own author/license notices.
0 // Native cords are constant-radius centreline constraints; see docs/construction.md.
0 // Run only the delivered finite 0 to720 to0 degree program after Reset.
